sequenceDiagram
    participant S as Traffic Sensor
    participant E as Edge Gateway
    participant I as IoT Core
    participant F as Flink Processor
    participant D as Database
    participant A as Alert Service
    participant U as User Dashboard

    Note over S,U: Normal Conditions
    S->>E: Speed: 60km/h, Volume: 50
    E->>I: Batch telemetry (5-min)
    I->>F: Stream data
    F->>D: Store observation
    U->>D: Query traffic (normal)

    Note over S,U: Incident Detected
    S->>E: Speed: 5km/h, Volume: 80
    E->>E: Local pattern match
    E->>I: Immediate alert + telemetry
    I->>F: Priority stream
    F->>F: Pattern detection (speed drop >80%)
    F->>D: Store incident record
    F->>A: Trigger incident alert
    A->>U: Push notification
    A->>U: WebSocket update
    
    Note over U: Real-time dashboard shows incident
    U->>D: Query incident details
    D-->>U: Incident data + affected area